title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (reformist_dissent > 30 and not reformists_resign) or (center_dissent > 30 and not centrists_resign) or (left_dissent > 30 and not sapd_formed) or (labor_dissent > 30 and not unions_independent) or (neorevisionist_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/gobprov.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

# TODO: party dissent events for every faction, have a good image for this... 

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if prietistas_dissent > 30 : The Prietistas are upset at our direction. Some voters could be lost to left republican parties  ?]
[? if besteiristas_dissent > 30 : The Besteiristas disagree with our present course of action. ?]
[? if caballeristas_dissent > 30: The Caballeristas are upset at our direction. They are making noises about joining the PCe. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_prietistas
- @concessions_besteiristas
- @concessions_caballeristas
- @do_nothing


@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: prietistas_dissent -= 5; besteiristas_dissent -= 5; caballeristas_dissent -= 5; workers_psoe -= 4; rural_psoe -= 2; unemployed_psoe -= 2

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_prietistas
title: Give concessions to the Prietistas.
view-if: prietistas_dissent > 30
on-arrival: prietistas_dissent -= 7; caballeristas_dissent += 5

We have promised to adopt a more reformist posture. This may alienate the left, however.

@concessions_besteiristas
title: Give concessions to the Besteiristas.
view-if: besteiristas_dissent > 30
on-arrival: besteiristas_dissent -= 7; caballeristas_dissent += 2; prietistas_dissent += 2

We have promised to take more policy suggestions from the Besteiristas. Both the left and reformist wings of the party might be displeased.

@concessions_caballeristas
title: Give concessions to the Caballeristas.
view-if: caballeristas_dissent > 30
on-arrival: caballeristas_dissent -= 7; prietistas_dissent += 5

We have promised that we will listen to the left wing of the party. Of course, this leads to increased dissent from the Prietistas.

@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 1; left_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 1; reformist_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.

# TODO: should we be allowed to preemptively expel factions?

@expel_prietistas
title: Expel the dissident Prietistas.
view-if: reformist_dissent > 30

@expel_caballeristas
title: Expel the dissident Caballeristas.
view-if: left_dissent > 30

@expel_besteiristas
title: Expel the Besteiristas.
view-if: center_dissent > 30
